{'symbol': 'RSG', 'date': '2021-11-19 09:04:00', 'title': 'REPUBLIC SERVICES NAMED TO DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX FOR SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'PHOENIX, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0REPUBLIC SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: RSG), A LEADER IN ENVIRONMENTAL SERVICES, WAS NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX (DJSI) FOR NORTH AMERICA FOR A SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR. THE COMPANY ALSO ADVANCED IN MSCI\'S ESG RATINGS TO AN "A," AHEAD OF ITS LARGEST INDUSTRY PEERS.'}